```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start(["开始"]):::startNode
    op_AbandonSession["AbandonSession"]:::opNode
    op_BootstrapSession["BootstrapSession"]:::opNode
    op_CloseConnection["CloseConnection"]:::opNode
    op_EstablishConnection["EstablishConnection"]:::opNode
    op_ReportConnectionLost["ReportConnectionLost"]:::opNode
    s_Abandoned(["Abandoned"]):::terminalNode
    s_Connected{"Connected"}:::decisionNode
    s_ConnectionLost{"ConnectionLost"}:::decisionNode
    s_Disconnected("Disconnected"):::stateNode

    op_AbandonSession --> s_Abandoned
    op_BootstrapSession --> s_Disconnected
    op_CloseConnection --> s_Disconnected
    op_EstablishConnection --> s_Connected
    op_ReportConnectionLost --> s_ConnectionLost
    s_Connected --> op_CloseConnection
    s_Connected --> op_ReportConnectionLost
    s_ConnectionLost --> op_AbandonSession
    s_ConnectionLost --> op_CloseConnection
    s_Disconnected --> op_EstablishConnection
    start --> op_BootstrapSession

    classDef startNode fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#0d47a1,stroke-width:2px
    classDef opNode fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#4a148c,stroke-width:1px
    classDef decisionNode fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef stateNode fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#1b5e20,stroke-width:1px
    classDef terminalNode fill:#eceff1,stroke:#37474f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef conflictOp fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
```

**操作说明**

| 名称 | 说明 |
| --- | --- |
| `BootstrapSession` | 创建尚未连线的设备会话 |
| `EstablishConnection` | 解析连接串、选择驱动并 connect，成功则进入 Connected |
| `ReportConnectionLost` | 网络异常导致连接意外断开 |
| `CloseConnection` | graceful close 回到 Disconnected |
| `AbandonSession` | 无法恢复的连接丢失进入终态 Abandoned |
